title: GettingToKnowEachOther
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<SetShot "Wide">>
Prince: You’re here every single day, you know?
Prince: Same time. Hours at a time.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: Assalamu alaikum, young man.
Munir: So you noticed my visits.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Hard not to.
Prince: Nobody else comes by that bed but you.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: That is my father.
Munir: He cannot speak, but he has not stopped teaching me.
// Hook: Munir’s father — future UnlockConversationTopic here.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Heh.
Prince: Teachin’ you by not sayin’ a thing?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: Noticing is a kind of care, young man.
Munir: My father taught me that.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: ...Yeah?
Prince: And what’s he got you noticin’ about me?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: That a heart your age should not fail.
Munir: I confess I have wondered about that.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Heh.
Prince: Wasn’t my best week.
Prince: They say my heart just gave out.
// Hook: Prince’s story — future UnlockConversationTopic here.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: Subhanallah.
Munir: Such a young heart, carrying so much already.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Yeah, well. Forget me, you know?
Prince: You come here every day for him.
Prince: Hours. Who does that?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: A son does that.
Munir: It is not something I decide each morning.
Munir: It is simply what I do.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Huh.
Prince: He’s lucky, havin’ somebody like that.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: And who looks after you, young man?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: ...No one.
Prince: It’s just me, you know?
Prince: This bed, my head, and a whole lotta quiet.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: I sit with silence every day at my father’s side.
Munir: It seemed a waste, letting a young man sit in silence next to me.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Heh.
Prince: So I’m just the noise, huh?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: Not noise, young man.
Munir: Company.
<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: ...Yeah.
Prince: Better company than my own head, anyway.
Prince: Wasn’t exactly plannin’ on talkin’ to anybody.
Prince: But here I am, you know?
<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: And here I am.
Munir: I will be here again tomorrow, God willing.
<<SetShot "TwoShot">>
Prince: Yeah. Me too.
Prince: Guess that makes us regulars, you know?
Munir: Masha’Allah. It is how most good things begin.
===
